# Contributing

Start with
[AGENTS.md](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate/blob/main/AGENTS.md) and the
skill
[manage-okmate-knowledge](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate/blob/main/.agents/skills/manage-okmate-knowledge/SKILL.md).

Public tracker: [github.com/koliyo/okmate](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate).

## Ownership

| Change | Owner |
| --- | --- |
| Portable OKF parse, validate, search, artifacts | `okf/` |
| CLI, live preview, Askama HTML, desktop window | this crate (`src/`, `templates/`) |
| Canonical knowledge bundle | `knowledge/` |
| Maintainer CI, release, PR checkout | `okmate-ops` |
| This product site | `site/` (Rocdown; compiled by external `rocdown`) |

Keep `knowledge/**/*.md` inert Markdown with OKF YAML.

## Validate

```sh
okmate check knowledge --profile strict --format terminal
cargo test -p okf
cargo test -p okmate --no-default-features
cargo fmt --all -- --check
```

Site sources:

```sh
rocdown check site
```

See [site/README.md](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate/blob/main/site/README.md).

